*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0009
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-06-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 963
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0009.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY FRD0009C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> HOLD TRANSACTION FLAG
    05 HF-FLG             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> MANUAL REVIEW FLAG
    05 WS-RVF             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 4000-CHANNEL-RULES
    DISPLAY "HF-FLG=" HF-FLG
    DISPLAY "WS-RVF=" WS-RVF
    STOP RUN.
4000-CHANNEL-RULES.
    IF TX-WS-CHN = 'O'
        EVALUATE TRUE
            *> CARD-NOT-PRESENT ONLINE PURCHASE
            WHEN TX-CP-FLG = 'N'
               AND TX-WS-TXAMT > 1000
                MOVE 'Y' TO HF-FLG
                MOVE 'Y' TO WS-RVF
            WHEN TX-WS-TXAMT > 15000
                MOVE 'Y' TO WS-RVF
        END-EVALUATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO HF-FLG
    END-IF.
